### 1. The Villain

Teams building AI platforms monitor GPU utilization and declare their observability done. The actual system has three independent failure surfaces — infrastructure, model backend/engine, and model serving — each with metrics, failure modes, and debugging approaches that have no equivalent in traditional software observability. Watching one layer tells you almost nothing about the others.

