- **Pressure:** Hands-on work with AI platforms revealed that networking, storage, model backends, and serving layers each have independent failure modes.
- **Decision/Realization:** Expanded mental model to include all three layers.
- **Outcome:** This webinar exists as a result.
- **Note:** Useful as a reader proxy. The target reader for this article is probably at the same stage Aditya describes being at — GPU-centric — and this story validates their starting point before the article expands their model.

